(b) Knowledge Distillation Prohibition: Use predictions, logits, token probability distributions, synthetic outputs, or reasoning traces generated by the Model to supervise, train, distill, or enhance any student model or competitive architecture.
(c) Derivative Weights Prohibition: Create, distribute, publish, or sublicense any derivative weight checkpoints, model merges, weight modifications, or reconstructed parameter states derived from the Model.
